<title>USA: TABLE-Eastman Chemical Q2 net income slips.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Eastman Chemical Q2 net income slips.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSPORT, Tenn. 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter		1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.14		    $1.41</p>
<p> Net			     90			112</p>
<p> Revs			 1,208		    1,241</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    78.7		     79.6</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.06		    $2.80</p>
<p> Net			    162			224</p>
<p> Revs			 2,379		    2,502</p>
<p> Avg			   78.5		     80.1</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q2 and six month EPS include a non-recurring gain of $0.10 a share from sale of food emulsifier business.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Eastman Chemical Co.</p>
</text>
